Journey: Sauce Demo login, cart and checkout
Tags: @saucedemo @smoke
Base URL: https://www.saucedemo.com
Variables: password=secret_sauce

Open /
Type "locked_out_user" into the Username field
Type "${password}" into the Password field
Click the "Login" button
  Expect the page contains "Sorry, this user has been locked out."
Type "standard_user" into the Username field
Type "${password}" into the Password field
Click the "Login" button
  Expect the URL contains "/inventory.html"
  Expect the page contains "Products"
Select "Price (low to high)" from the dropdown
  Expect the 1st "Sauce Labs Onesie" text is visible
Click the "Add to cart" button in the row containing "Sauce Labs Backpack"
  Expect the "Remove" button in the row containing "Sauce Labs Backpack" is visible
Click the "Add to cart" button in the row containing "Sauce Labs Bike Light"
  Expect testid=shopping-cart-badge has text "2"
Click testid=shopping-cart-link
  Expect the URL contains "/cart.html"
  Expect the page contains "Sauce Labs Bike Light"
Click the "Remove" button in the row containing "Sauce Labs Bike Light"
  Expect testid=shopping-cart-badge has text "1"
Click the "Checkout" button
Click the "Continue" button
  Expect the page contains "Error: First Name is required"
Type "Ada" into the First Name field
Type "Lovelace" into the Last Name field
Type "10115" into the Zip/Postal Code field
Click the "Continue" button
  Expect the URL contains "/checkout-step-two.html"
  Expect the page contains "Item total: $29.99"
  Expect the page contains "Total: $32.39"
Click the "Finish" button
  Expect the page contains "Thank you for your order!"
Click the "Back Home" button
  Expect the URL contains "/inventory.html"
